{{Quote|I assumed that much. I didn't think you wanted droid repair. And where would this pilot take you?''"<br />"''To the Kashyyyk system.''"<br />"''That is under Imperial control.|[[Evaan Verlaine]] and [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]]|<ref name="Life Debt" />}}
The '''Kashyyyk system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[Mytaranor sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]. It contained the [[planet]]s [[Kashyyyk]] and [[Trandosha]], as well as Trandosha's [[moon]], [[Wasskah]].<ref name="USW" /> During the [[Clone Wars]], both the [[Battle on Wasskah|skirmish]] on Wasskah<ref name="PL">{{TCW|Padawan Lost}}</ref> and the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]] occurred in the system.<ref name="ROTS" />

